{"message":"feat(tactics): construct and refine dependent proofs with scoped synthetic goals\n\nApply admitted constructors transactionally. Keep explicit proof holes opaque, close their captured telescopes, and preserve annotations and unused obligations. Resume independent inference without weakening strict rewrite or instance selection. Preserve the concurrent function-child checker implementation.\n\nLocal integrated five-package suite: 1877 top-level tests pass with zero failures or ignored tests; scoped Clippy, workspace compilation and changed-file formatting pass. No new axioms, unsafe code, dependencies or admission authority. Remote verification and non-forced publication required. Related: fln-kpd, fln-qb5.","parts":["25a6117fb3c4c35ccd93cc2c131aa1d54a7dcfac","6229082680719e2d31ac41aca873402bc7bba42e","27d5de2f5c3fbc8569f3ff1d75181101033ec996","a8b709b742b3d96ece967c0231fd4ef0f6afcb32","6a6e26dda226599ae701c8ac585d2c1bbb1974d4"],"length":60008,"sha256":"e500b887732281eba628b3ce2ca9d3eff7636dffffabb0a58c020c57105e87ec","base_blobs":{"crates/fln-cli/tests/source_check.rs":"37ce95b5eb390f3fad78a3390e502704bbafc165","crates/fln-elab/src/source.rs":"be328b1ea9110d3f76e4768c7b662ac38e187781","crates/fln-elab/src/source/instances.rs":"f5b514ecb8527c6e11c0d44096253a17276135e6","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics.rs":"a658c7f41d9cd4b90ed75889fd2776f849c71293","crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/construct.rs":null,"crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/refine.rs":null,"crates/fln-elab/src/source/tactics/rewrite/matching.rs":"7350368510378effaeade36668fa72646016200f","crates/fln-parse/src/lib.rs":"5fec41a4de03419c63ac8383f67777da4834d20f","crates/fln-parse/src/proofs.rs":"ca34e9a6144be238bacf03f2cbb91249718787ba","crates/fln/tests/source_construction.rs":null,"crates/fln/tests/source_refinement.rs":null,"docs/NATIVE_PROOF_CONSTRUCTION.md":null,"docs/NATIVE_REFINEMENT.md":null,"examples/native_constructor_tactics.lean":null,"examples/native_refinement.lean":null},"sourc